From cf357619b8eb35c707d7233438fc8b64c1bd34b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qinwei <jean.qinwei@contributor>


Date: Thu, 18 Sep 2025 21:24:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] BUGFIX Use sysbench PGO/LTO optimize InnoDB storage
 engine

Issue:
------
Currently PGO/LTO compilation optimization only train the Dstore table,
do not train InnoDB table.

Solution:
---------
Add sysbench PGO/LTO test cases for InnoDB storage engine.


cherry-pick merge request: BUGFIX Use sysbench PGO/LTO optimize InnoDB storage engine

840ab911cbb0971e52683fcc2ab1e75d592fe178

This cherry-pick merge request !4919
